<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist upgraded Read-Rite Corp to buy from hold, the analyst's office said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 9/16 to 18.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst, Todd Bakar, said in a report that &quot;the tide has clearly turned at Read-Rite as demand appears to be steadily accelerating and internal company execution appears significantly improved across all product fronts.&quot;</p>
</text>
